{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260601_101754_p54_b17", "persona_id": "db:54", "outcome": "FOLLOW_UP", "content": "1. 在S2阶段，复述确认（reflection_paraphrase）使用不超过2次，一旦客户确认痛点，立即转入S3价值锚定，避免重复导致客户厌烦。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260601_102539"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260601_101754_p54_b17", "persona_id": "db:54", "outcome": "FOLLOW_UP", "content": "2. 面对高怀疑度客户，书面承诺（手写条款、盖章）是建立信任的关键，但需配合现场演示（如真机展示GMS运行）来强化可信度。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260601_102539"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260601_101754_p54_b17", "persona_id": "db:54", "outcome": "FOLLOW_UP", "content": "3. 当客户说'需要时间考虑'时，不要立即同意，应尝试'假设成交法'（如'那我们先帮您激活设备？'）或'稀缺性施压'（如'这款库存紧张，今天下单可锁定优惠'）。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260601_102539"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260601_101754_p54_b17", "persona_id": "db:54", "outcome": "FOLLOW_UP", "content": "4. 线下场景必须包含至少一次真机上手体验，让客户通过感官确认产品价值，减少抽象疑虑。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260601_102539"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260601_101754_p54_b17", "persona_id": "db:54", "outcome": "FOLLOW_UP", "content": "5. 合同条款讨论不宜超过3轮，否则客户会陷入细节焦虑；应在第2轮后主动总结并引导至价值层面。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260601_102539"}
